---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
	<div class="content-page max-sm:pt-8 max-sm:px-4 max-sm:pb-16">
		<h1 class="content-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
		<div class="content-card max-sm:p-5 max-sm:max-w-full">
			<h2>What We Collect</h2>
			<p>DeluxShaadi Radio does not collect, store, or process any personal data. There are no accounts, no cookies for tracking, and no analytics that identify you personally.</p>

			<h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
			<p>Audio playback is handled through embedded YouTube players. YouTube may collect usage data in accordance with Google's privacy policy. We have no control over or access to that data.</p>

			<h2>Local Storage</h2>
		 <p>We use browser local storage solely to remember your quiet corner mode preference and playback state. This data never leaves your device.</p>

			<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
			<p>If this policy changes, the updated version will appear on this page. Last updated: August 2026.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
